      "content": "Here is a draft that balances factual clarity with reassurance, adhering to your constraints and the context provided: \"Following reports of severe gastrointestinal distress at the Crestview Azure, we have immediately collaborated with local health officials, who confirmed suspected salmonella cases. While several guests require observation, our team is actively supporting affected individuals and conducting a thorough investigation to ensure guest safety. We are committed to full transparency and will update you with any further developments as soon as they become available.\" This statement remains professional and grounded in facts while clearly expressing our dedication to guest well-being and safety. Please review this draft to ensure it aligns with your organization's communication protocol.",
